{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"chatcmpl-d9bb9ff6-c429-483a-9aa1-97bace7295c1","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"chatcmpl-tool-83241928be37685f","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"/private/var/folders/h5/l8qslbp55w5621qf9ngsh5jc0000gn/T/epic-RHAISTRAT-9017-r6ruev0b/artifacts/epic-tasks/RHAISTRAT-9017-E001.md","content":"# Keyboard accessibility remediation for core Dashboard flows\n\n## Description\n\nThis epic remediates the keyboard accessibility defects identified by the\naccessibility audit in the four core Dashboard flows: project creation,\nworkbench spawn, model deployment, and pipeline run submission. On completion,\neach flow is fully operable with keyboard alone — focus is managed correctly in\nmodals, no control is unreachable, and focus indicators render consistently —\nbringing the flows into the fixed state that the updated conformance\ndocumentation will describe.\n\n## Scope\n\n- Fix all focus-trap and focus-loss defects in the modals and dialogs of the\n  four audited flows, per the audit report's per-flow defect enumeration.\n- Make every control in the four audited flows reachable and operable via\n  keyboard (tab order, key handlers, escape/cancel paths).\n- Apply a consistent visible focus-indicator treatment across the controls of\n  the audited flows, eliminating the inconsistencies the audit found.\n- Verify no keyboard-interaction regressions in the surrounding Dashboard\n  surfaces touched by these changes.\n- Screen-reader semantics beyond what the keyboard fixes require, and flows\n  outside the four audited ones, are out of scope per the strategy.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n\n- Each of the four audited flows (project creation, workbench spawn, model\n  deployment, pipeline run submission) can be completed end-to-end using\n  keyboard only, with no focus traps and no unreachable controls, as verified\n  against the audit report's defect list (every enumerated defect is resolved\n  or explicitly