ublic location.\n- The product docs accessibility statement is updated and republished.\n- The documented conformance claims are technically reviewed against the\n  implemented keyboard accessibility remediation, and the review sign-off is\n  recorded (reviewer and date).\n- The published documents contain no claims that contradict the implemented\n  state of the four flows.\n\n## HLR Traceability\n\n- **HLR-3** (P2): the accessibility conformance documentation (VPAT and product\n  docs accessibility statement) is updated and republished to reflect the fixed\n  state, with technical review — this epic's full scope.\n"}}],"model":"rits/zai-org/glm-5-3","stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":25313,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-a69808f9e2a74486","agent_id":"a5ad69b508ae2bc77","session_id":"84025926-e088-44a2-8c99-e9522ae1f2f6","uuid":"833883f2-ce4c-43c7-a17b-88a47c1426be","timestamp":"2026-10-23T18:56:32.646Z","subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Decompose RHAISTRAT-9017"}
